CATALOG FILEFORMAT
(semi-colon seperated)

event_name,origin_time;x;y;depth

event_name...		derived from origin time YYYYMMDDHHMMSS.MICROSECONDS (UTC)
origin_time...      YYYY-MM-DD_HH:MM:SS.MICROSECONDS(6 digits) (UTC)
x...                aspo96 system (m)
y...                aspo96 system (m)
depth...            aspo96 system (m)